{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"A total of 8 patients completed 41 walking tests, 30 of which had frozen episodes, and 21 of the 30 raw data were level 1 or 2 in quality (70%).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"A total of 8 patients completed 41 walking tests, 30 of which had frozen episodes, and 21 of the 30 raw data were level 1 or 2 in quality (70%).\",\n    \"Therefore, before selecting each segment of electrical signal for analysis, we manually reviewed and scaled the signal quality, and selected level 1 or level 2 for subsequent analysis (Table 2).\",\n    \"We selected each segment of electrical signal reaching level 1 or 2 for analysis, and of all the data collected in this study, more than 70% have limited motion artifacts, which also confirms the stability of our data collection platform.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"原文同时明确报告了两个事实，因此二者并不矛盾。第一，30次行走测试确实出现了冻结事件，故将该研究描述为包含30次冻结测试有明确依据。第二，原文明确指出，30份冻结相关原始数据中，只有21份（70%）达到1级或2级质量；方法部分还明确说明，后续分析选择的是达到1级或2级质量的数据。因此，指控者关于原始数据质量存在限制的描述有充分依据，不能不加区分地把30次测试全部视为同等质量的数据。不过，原文并未说明另一份报告如何具体处理这些数据，也无法仅凭论文全文确认该报告是否确实遗漏了质量限定。因此，report_supported判为partly，而不是no：30次冻结测试这一数量本身没有误读，但如果跨研究比较将30次全部作为同等质量的有效数据而未体现21/30的质量限定，则会遗漏重要信息。另需注意，原文并未直接将其余9份数据定义为完全无效，只说明它们未达到后续分析所选择的1级或2级质量标准。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5026e6ec-289d-4aec-9f5f-50fd36fd03d9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T204325241906Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T20:44:16.258295+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f04a5a325b4e1e851ac03384534c0e9b73bd962f7e36ce063ea6f0085084ef80", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T204325241906Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "60db66352a02510fc4ed4067a73e09e2a9dccc59dd9aada52061351881bf1de4"}}}
